# An AUTH_SYS credential's body (RFC 5531 Appendix A): stamp 0x1234, machine name "host1", uid 1000, gid 1000, groups 10, 20 and 30.
00001234  # stamp
00000005 686f7374 31000000  # machine name "host1", 5 bytes and its padding
000003e8  # uid 1000
000003e8  # gid 1000
00000003  # three groups
0000000a 00000014 0000001e  # 10, 20, 30
